   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kyiv Economic Institute: 2009-2012</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kyiv Economics Institute (KEI) etablerades 2005 av Stockholm          Institute for Transition Economics (SITE) med st&#xf6;d av Sida. KEI har   sedan dess etablerat sig som ett nationellt center f&#xf6;r forskning och  policyst&#xf6;d i ekonomiska och governance-relaterade fr&#xe5;gor. Den svenska insatsen 2009-2012 representerar en utfasningsperiod, efter att       st&#xf6;det tidigare f&#xf6;rl&#xe4;ngts f&#xf6;r att klara den ekonomiska krisen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Kyiv Economics Institute (KEI) was established in 2005 by the     Stockholm Institute for Transition Economics (SITE) with the help of  a grant from Sida. KEI has established itself as a national center of excellence in economics and governance research and policy advice.    The Swedish contribution of 2009-2012 represents a phase-out period.</narrative>
  </description>
